  "project_description": "This module adds a \"Belgian National Insurance Number\" element to the Webform module. The Belgian National Insurance Number is known locally as \"Rijksregisternummer\" (nl) or \"Numero de registre national\" (fr). The element renders as a masked text field (999999-999-99) and validates the number's modulo-97 checksum, accepting both pre-2000 and post-2000 birth-date encodings. Requires the Webform module.",
